---
import { EVENT_DATA } from '../consts';
---

<section id="ubicacio-allotjament" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
	<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
		
		<!-- Section Header -->
		<div class="text-center mb-16">
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
				<span>📍 Ubicació & Allotjament</span>
			</div>
			<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white font-heading tracking-tight mb-4">
				Com arribar i <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 to-teal-300">On dormir</span>
			</h2>
			<p class="text-slate-300 max-w-xl mx-auto text-base sm:text-lg">
				Tot el que necessites saber per arribar a temps i gaudir de la festa sense preocupacions de tornada.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Two-column grid: Location & Hotel -->
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
			
			<!-- Card 1: Venue / La Pèrgola -->
			<div class="glass-card glass-card-hover rounded-3xl p-8 border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
				<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-36 h-36 bg-orange-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

				<div>
					<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6">
						🎪
					</div>

					<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange-400">El Lloc de la Festa</span>
					<h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-heading text-white mt-1 mb-3">
						La Pèrgola
					</h3>
					<p class="text-amber-300/90 font-medium text-sm mb-4">
						Carpes Vig Estiu · Vic (Barcelona)
					</p>

					<p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
						Un espai a l'aire lliure, ampli i acollidor per passar del vermut del migdia al ball sota les estrelles. Zona amb ombra, gespa i zona chill-out.
					</p>

					<ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8">
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
							<span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span>
							<span><strong>Horari:</strong> 13:00 h a 00:00 h</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
							<span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span>
							<span><strong>Aparcament:</strong> Zona d'aparcament habilitada al recinte</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
							<span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span>
							<span><strong>Dress Code:</strong> Festival estiuenc & calçat còmode per ballar</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<a
					href={EVENT_DATA.mapsUrl}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full py-3.5 px-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 border border-white/20 text-white font-bold text-sm transition-all text-center group"
				>
					<span>Obrir a Google Maps</span>
					<svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
						<path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
					</svg>
				</a>
			</div>

			<!-- Card 2: Hotel / Up Rooms Vic -->
			<div class="glass-card glass-card-hover rounded-3xl p-8 border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
				<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-36 h-36 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

				<div>
					<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6">
						🏨
					</div>

					<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-400">Per a la gent de fora de Vic</span>
					<h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-heading text-white mt-1 mb-3">
						Up Rooms Vic
					</h3>
					<p class="text-emerald-300/90 font-medium text-sm mb-4">
						Allotjament recomanat a Vic
					</p>

					<p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
						Si vens de fora i vols gaudir de la festa fins al final sense haver d'agafar el cotxe de nit, et recomanem reservar habitació amb temps a l'hotel <strong>Up Rooms Vic</strong>.
					</p>

					<ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8">
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
							<span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span>
							<span>Hotel modern i cèntric a Vic</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
							<span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span>
							<span>Molt bona connexió i fàcil accés</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
							<span class="text-amber-400">⚠️</span>
							<span class="text-amber-200">Recomanem reservar amb antelació per assegurar plaça</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<a
					href={EVENT_DATA.hotelUrl}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full py-3.5 px-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-400 hover:to-teal-500 text-slate-950 font-bold text-sm transition-all text-center shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20 group"
				>
					<span>Veure i Reservar a Up Rooms Vic</span>
					<svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-950 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
						<path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth="2.5" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
					</svg>
				</a>
			</div>

		</div>

		<!-- FOMO Banner Reminder -->
		<div class="mt-10 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500/15 via-rose-500/15 to-amber-500/15 border border-orange-500/30 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
			<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
				<span class="text-2xl mb-2 block">🔥</span>
				<h4 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold font-heading text-white mb-2">
					"Guarda la data que el FOMO et pot arribar a durar 40 anys"
				</h4>
				<p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base">
					No cada dia es canvia de dècada. Ens veiem el 19 de Juny del 2027 a La Pèrgola!
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

	</div>
</section>
